<title>USA: Donnelly Corp to make mirrors for Audi.</title>
<headline>Donnelly Corp to make mirrors for Audi.</headline>
<dateline>HOLLAND, Mich. 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Donnelly Corp on Wednesday it won a contract to make interior mirrors for a luxury sedan being produced by Audi AG.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not announced.</p>
<p>The U.S. automotive supply company said each year it would deliver 60,000 electrochromic mirrors, which dim automatically, to Audi for its A6 luxury sedans. The contract is Donnelly's first to make such mirrors for Audi's luxury vehicles, the company said.</p>
<p>Its shares were up 1/8 at 16-3/4 in early afternoon trading.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-87878))</p>
